// Title: Remote Access Tool - TacticalRMM Agent Registration to Potentially Attacker-Controlled Server
// Rule ID: 2db93a3f-3249-4f73-9e68-0e77a0f8ae7e
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.command-and-control, attack.t1219, attack.t1105
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_sentinel
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_remote_access_tools_tacticalrmm_agent_registration_via_cli.yml
